#   Container Agent  <──rendezvous──  Host dropper writes /dev/shm/.<token>
#   Container Agent  ──instructions──>  Host dropper reads /dev/shm/.<token>.cmd
#   Host             ──deploys──────>   Full orchestrator running as root on host
